<p>Hello <%= @user.username %>,</p>

<p>Someone asked for a link to change the password of your gitito account. If it was you, choose a new one here:</p>

<p><%= link_to "Change my password", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token), class: "mail__button" %></p>

<p class="mail__muted">
  This link will expire in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.
  If you didn't ask for it, ignore this email: your password stays as it is until you open the link and choose a new one.
</p>
